cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Gated-QKANFWPs: Quantum-inspired KAN fast-weight programmers across RL, solar-cycle forecasting, and time-series benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementations and training pipelines for four quantum-inspired
  Kolmogorov-Arnold Network fast-weight programmers (qqkanfwp, lqkanfwp,
  qkanlfwp, qkanvfwp), evaluated on three tasks: A3C reinforcement learning in
  MiniGrid, SILSO solar-cycle (sunspot) forecasting, and a quantum-dynamics
  time-series benchmark suite.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MatthewPeng57/Gated-QKANFWPs"
keywords:
  - Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks
  - fast weight programmers
  - quantum machine learning
  - time series forecasting
  - reinforcement learning

# TODO(before release): complete the author list — add co-authors, ORCIDs and
